      "symbol": "useTicker",
      "line": 10,
      "offset": 0,
      "text": "Three more character fields, each a different motion so the page does not\nrepeat one motif. All share the contract of AsciiHelix and AsciiFluid: two\n<pre> layers, deterministic first paint, paused off-screen, static under\nreduced motion, and a tick rate low enough to read as ambient texture.",
      "kind": "what"
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
